{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","往赴极乐"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标位置附近的全部敌人造成多次伤害并魅惑敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","梅希拉在目标地点生成吻痕，对半径2格范围内的所有敌人冲击6次造成50% + 5% ATK伤害，短暂停顿后，对范围内的敌人强力冲击造成170% + 25% ATK伤害。\n受到强力冲击影响的敌人会被魅惑持续3秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":70,"end":76,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":66,"end":80,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":97,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"keyword:enchanted"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","强力冲击造成的伤害提升至190% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","强力冲击造成的伤害提升至210% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","强力冲击造成的伤害提升至230% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","强力冲击造成的伤害提升至250% + 25% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","欢愉鞭挞"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对面前扇形区域造成多次不分敌我的生命流失效果，命中友方时额外提升急速。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","梅希拉不分敌我地挥动鞭子鞭笞前方半径3格扇形区域内的角色5次，每次鞭笞使其流失20% + 3% ATK的生命。若命中友军，则额外提高其急速25点，持续8秒。该技能对友军造成的生命流失效果降低90%，并且选择能命中最多敌人的方向释放。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次鞭笞造成的生命流失提升至24% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次鞭笞造成的生命流失提升至28% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次鞭笞造成的生命流失提升至32% + 3% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","魅影狂潮"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","吸引全场敌人到目标位置附近。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在距离所有敌人最近位置生成梅希拉的幻象诱惑全场敌人，使他们陷入“痴迷”状态并狂热地奔向幻象，持续2.2 + 0.1秒。战斗开始时会立刻在梅希拉对称的位置生成一次幻象。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“痴迷”状态的持续时间提升至2.3 + 0.1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“痴迷”状态的持续时间提升至2.4 + 0.1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“痴迷”状态的持续时间提升至2.5 + 0.1秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中生命汲取提升，恢复一定生命值后可提高攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","生命汲取提高8点，当自身受到任意来源的生命恢复值达到40%初始最大生命值时，提高6%攻击力，最多可提高18%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","生命汲取提高10点，当自身受到任意来源的生命恢复值达到40%初始最大生命值时，提高8%攻击力，最多可提高24%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","生命汲取提高12点，当自身受到任意来源的生命恢复值达到40%初始最大生命值时，提高10%攻击力，最多可提高30%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","奉献之爱"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤使魔在身边持续攻击敌人，在危险时献祭使魔使自身暂时无法被选中并恢复生命。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，梅希拉召唤3只使魔环绕自身，使魔每1.5秒会攻击敌人造成40% ATK伤害。若梅希拉受到任意伤害后生命值即将低于20%，则献祭一个使魔来抵消本次伤害，并使自身在后续2.5秒内无法被选中、且立刻恢复20%最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","使魔攻击造成的伤害提升至50% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使魔攻击造成的伤害提升至60% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","梅希拉储存溢出的生命恢复量，每存储相当于50%初始最大生命值的恢复量，便额外召唤一只使魔，每场战斗最多额外召唤3只使魔。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","处于自身的魅惑和痴迷效果的敌人受到的伤害增加。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","受到技能“往赴极乐”的魅惑效果或技能“魅影狂潮”的痴迷效果影响的敌人，受到的伤害提高15%，该效果不可叠加。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"keyword:enchanted"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","屈服之鞭"]]}